# gh-pages: the GitHub Pages deploy branch.
#
# This branch is an ORPHAN of main and holds exactly one published artifact:
# index.html, a copy of SWGR-Space-Tool.html from main. Everything else in
# this working folder is private (HTML backups, feature specs, personal CSV
# exports containing Owned parts and ship loadouts, local tooling), so ignore
# everything by default and un-ignore only what we intend to publish.
#
# To update the published site after changing the tool on main:
#
#   git checkout gh-pages
#   git checkout main -- SWGR-Space-Tool.html
#   mv SWGR-Space-Tool.html index.html
#   git add index.html && git commit -m "Publish <what changed>" && git push
#   git checkout main
#
# Or, without disturbing the main working tree (what the 2026-08-05 publish did):
#
#   git worktree add /tmp/ghp gh-pages
#   cp SWGR-Space-Tool.html /tmp/ghp/index.html
#   git -C /tmp/ghp commit -am "Publish <what changed>" && git -C /tmp/ghp push
#   git worktree remove /tmp/ghp
#
/*
!.gitignore
!index.html
